.TH ciaaw_ices 3 "30 August 2026" "1.3.2" "Library calls"

.SH NAME
\"{{{
ices \- get the isotopic compositions
\"}}}

.SH LIBRARY
\"{{{
ciaaw library 
.RI ( libciaaw ", " \-lciaaw )
\"}}}

.SH SYNOPSIS
\"{{{
.IP Fortran 10
.BI "function ice(" s )result(res)
.RS
.IP "" 3
.BI "character(len=*), intent(in)  :: " s             
.IP "" 3
.BI "real(dp), pointer  :: " res(:,:)                 
.RE

.IP C 10
.BI "double *ciaaw_ices(char *" s, "int " n );

\"}}}

.SH DESCRIPTION
Get all the isotopic compositions of the element \fIs\fP.

Arguments:
.IP \fIs\fP 10
Element symbol.

.SH RETURN VALUE
.IP (n,3)array 10
Fortran order array with the mass number, the composition and the 
uncertainty for the \fIn\fP isotopes.
.IP NULL 10 
If the provided element is incorrect.
.SH SEE ALSO
